Swordfish-Publications
----------------------

Schema validation uses third_party/Swordfish-Publications when a Redfish
document references a Swordfish type. Nothing from it is shipped in the proxy
image. It is published by the Storage Networking Industry Association (SNIA)
under the BSD-3-Clause License. The licence text is
third_party/Swordfish-Publications/LICENSE.


